  "_about": "Later-game / dearer items give more Life Force. Estimated values (footprint, tree, producing tree) gain the bonus of the highest band their WORTH reaches; documented ZF1 values and overrides never change, and a recolour takes its base item's final value. Worth is in purchase-equivalent gold: a gold price as is; a brain price x brainGold/sellBack; an award-only prize its authored sell value (src/awardSellValue.ts) / sellBack. A band is [worthFloor, flatBonus, percentBonus]: the bonus is the LARGER of the flat amount (so small items still notice) and percent x the item's base (so big items scale instead of a flat +4 vanishing on 16). The bonus is added after the size cap.",
